<!-- The Bankr. D. Kan. adversary complaint's Word styles: the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs) in the
     face of the typst template ({font}, Times New Roman; no D. Kan. rule names a face) at 16 pt (size 32 half points:
     D. Kan. LBR 9004.1(a)(1), 12 pt or larger and no more than 12 characters per inch on average); Body Text in exact
     32 pt line boxes (typst pitch-double, LBR 9004.1(a)(1) double spaced: two type sizes) with a half-inch indent;
     the court, caption, title, signature and table lines in 18.4 pt boxes (typst pitch-single, 1.15 x the size);
     letter page with 1-inch margins and a centered page number at the bottom of every page from the first (LBR
     9004.1(a)(2)), its line 32.25 pt above the page foot (645 twips: where typst sets its 18.4 pt line box, footer-descent 30 %). The
     markdown is read as CommonMark with pipe tables, as cmarker reads it. docx/ksb-adversary-complaint.lua writes
     every paragraph's own spacing. Twips: 20 x pt. -->
<reference xmlns:w="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" base="xengine" pandoc-from="commonmark+smart+yaml_metadata_block+pipe_tables" size="32" body="640" single="368" indent="720" heading="640" heading-before="0" heading-after="0" quote="368" footer="645"/>
